                <h2>Your Rights</h2>
                <p>Regardless of your location, Scoutix respects your right to control your personal information. You may exercise the following rights by contacting us at <strong>support@scoutix.io</strong>:</p>
                <div class="rights-grid">
                    <div class="right-item"><div class="right-icon">👁</div><h4>Access</h4><p>Request a copy of the personal data we hold about you</p></div>
                    <div class="right-item"><div class="right-icon">✏️</div><h4>Correction</h4><p>Request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data</p></div>
                    <div class="right-item"><div class="right-icon">🗑</div><h4>Deletion</h4><p>Request deletion of your account and personal data</p></div>
                    <div class="right-item"><div class="right-icon">📦</div><h4>Portability</h4><p>Request a machine-readable export of your account data</p></div>
                    <div class="right-item"><div class="right-icon">🚫</div><h4>Opt-Out</h4><p>Unsubscribe from marketing communications at any time</p></div>
                    <div class="right-item"><div class="right-icon">⚖️</div><h4>Object</h4><p>Object to processing where legitimate interest is the legal basis</p></div>
