                <div class="section-number">Section 10</div>
                <h2>California Residents — CCPA / CPRA Rights</h2>
                <p>If you are a California resident, the California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) as amended by the California Privacy Rights Act (CPRA) may provide you with additional rights regarding your personal information.</p>

                <div class="jurisdiction-grid">
                    <div class="jurisdiction-card ca">
                        <h4>🏛 Your California Rights</h4>
                        <p><strong>Know:</strong> Request disclosure of the categories and specific pieces of personal information we have collected about you.</p>
                        <p><strong>Delete:</strong> Request deletion of your personal information, subject to certain exceptions.</p>
                        <p><strong>Correct:</strong> Request correction of inaccurate personal information.</p>
                        <p><strong>Opt-Out of Sale:</strong> Scoutix does not sell personal information. We do not sell or share your data with third parties for cross-context behavioral advertising.</p>
                        <p><strong>Non-Discrimination:</strong> We will not discriminate against you for exercising any CCPA rights.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="jurisdiction-card eu">
                        <h4>📋 How to Submit a Request</h4>
                        <p>To exercise any California privacy rights, contact us at:</p>
                        <p><strong>Email:</strong> support@scoutix.io</p>
                        <p><strong>Subject line:</strong> "CCPA Privacy Request"</p>
                        <p>We will verify your identity before processing your request and will respond within <strong>45 days</strong> as permitted under CCPA. We may extend this period by an additional 45 days when reasonably necessary with prior notice.</p>
                    </div>
