                <p>The business information surfaced through Scoutix's platform is sourced from publicly available online directories and listings. Scoutix makes no representations or warranties regarding the accuracy, completeness, timeliness, or fitness for any particular purpose of such third-party data.</p>
                <p>Business contact details, addresses, operating hours, and other information may be outdated, incomplete, or inaccurate. Users are solely responsible for verifying any business data before using it for outreach, marketing, or any other commercial purpose. Scoutix shall not be liable for any losses, claims, or damages arising from reliance on third-party business data obtained through the platform.</p>
            </section>

